# The smoke set: api integration tests that run on EVERY affected run, whatever
# changed. Cheap, broad, and each one a different way the api can be broken as a
# whole: boot, a workspace's birth, its walls, its roles, its tokens, a module's
# lifecycle, a wire firing, an install's postcondition, the census tests that
# read every module. Keep each under ~5s; a slow smoke test is a tax on every PR.
# Read by scripts/ci-affected.mjs; checked by lint:test-affects.
core-healthcheck.test.ts
signup-gate.test.ts
tenant-isolation.test.ts
org-roles.test.ts
token-scopes.test.ts
require-scope.test.ts
module-crud.test.ts
wire-events.test.ts
install-postcondition.test.ts
entity-kinds-enabled-only.test.ts
list-skips-disabled-modules.test.ts
all-bundles-validate.test.ts
action-role-parity.test.ts
migrate-concurrency.test.ts
